Web browser built with Python and Qt-Webengine.

Feature Ideas:
* Highly customizable UI and theming.
* Custom robust extension system.
* Chrome addons if possible.
* Native AI frontend for self hosted bots.
* Userscript management.
* Highly customizable new tab page.
* Customizable keybinds.
* Keybinds for basic browser interaction (ex clicks, moving focus to buttons, etc).
* Helium Bangs.
* Built in notepad.